#  WHAT THIS FILE DOES
#  -------------------
#  1. Sets developer env     — history, editor, pager, PATH (no duplicates)
#  2. Loads bash_aliases     — short command aliases
#  3. Loads bash_functions   — shell functions (xc, con, mkidx, kccdb, ...)
#  4. Configures the prompt  — exit code, git branch, cross-compile target
#  5. Tool integrations      — bash-completion, fzf, zoxide, direnv
#  6. Loads ~/.bash_local    — LAST, so your machine-specific config wins
